Z||000004||Monkeyman||12-19-1999||12:52 PM||||Thanx.  I thought that maybe all Fieros had tilt, too, like Wolfie said.  I've got an '86 SC now and the only options it has are the sunroof, A/C, and auto.  It has tilt.  Maybe just the '84s didn't have tilt as standard?  I guess they were a very different car.  (Harder to swap parts from an '84 to any other year and vice versa-at least that's what I've been told)||||reg||1
